# KPI Definition & Business Metric Design

## 1. Overview

This assignment defines business KPIs formally so that stakeholders can use consistent metric definitions, formulas, targets, and computation methods.

The analysis focuses on converting raw business measurements into reusable KPIs that can be calculated consistently from the available data.

---

## 2. Objectives

The KPI analysis aims to:

- Define at least five business KPIs.
- Document each KPI with its definition, formula, source, target, owner, frequency, and notes.
- Implement reusable Python functions for KPI computation.
- Validate calculated KPIs against defined target ranges.
- Generate a KPI validation report.
- Decompose a top-level KPI into lower-level business components.
- Store KPI definitions and targets in version-controlled files.

