## 6. KPI Validation Report

The validation report contains:

| Field      | Description              |
| ---------- | ------------------------ |
| KPI        | KPI name                 |
| Actual     | Calculated KPI value     |
| Target Min | Minimum acceptable value |
| Target Max | Maximum acceptable value |
| Status     | PASS or ALERT            |

This provides a consistent view of current KPI performance against defined expectations.

