## 8. KPI Governance

Each KPI should have a clearly documented:

* Name
* Definition
* Formula
* Data source
* Target range
* Owner
* Update frequency
* Notes

This prevents different teams from calculating the same KPI using different definitions.

If the underlying data schema changes, the KPI formula and data-source documentation should also be reviewed and updated.

